      "value": "@{5f2cc09ac00297464bd2dd84|full_name} i think the initial explaination to use the setting \"Hide Avatars Beyond\" is the confussiong part here. That setting needs to stay untouched from user perspective. While having additional settings to hide avatars beyond a specific distance or outside a specific room sounds reasonable from world designer perspective. 30ppl/50m is not enough as you said, too. But the Canny for it seems to have no progress at all.",
